  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "心理劇與自我成長",
    "sub_ename": "PSYCHODRAMA AND PERSONAL GROWTH",
    "describe_ch": "心理劇是一種獨特、生動、有力的心靈演出方法，幫助個人探索、發現與重新擁有自己的內在資源與優勢。本課程將藉由團體互動、角色扮演 與其他心理劇方法，將人生的過去、現在與未來具象化地呈現於此時此刻，啟動個人的內在資源與關於人際的理解。在教學與體驗過程中，將運用理性選擇視框來省思改變的可能性與機制。",
    "describe_eh": "Psychodrama is a set of unique and powerful action methods which help us explore and reclaim our inner strength and resources. This course will use group interaction, role-playing, and other psychodrmatic techniques to present our past, present and future scenes in the here-and-now format. The learning and experiencing process will activate our inner resources and facilitate our interpersonal learning. A rational choice perspective will be used to enhance self-awareness and growth.",
